 "description": "<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(36, 36, 36); border: 1pt windowtext; padding: 0cm; font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;\">Oportunidade para <strong>Advogado(a) S&ecirc;nior em Contencioso C&iacute;vel Geral</strong>, com atua&ccedil;&atilde;o em carteira diversificada e multitem&aacute;tica de processos, envolvendo demandas como <strong>Direito de Fam&iacute;lia, Recupera&ccedil;&atilde;o de Cr&eacute;dito, quest&otilde;es contratuais, responsabilidade civil, obriga&ccedil;&otilde;es e demais mat&eacute;rias relacionadas ao Direito Civil</strong>.</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(36, 36, 36); border: 1pt windowtext; padding: 0cm; font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;\">Busca-se profissional com s&oacute;lida experi&ecirc;ncia contenciosa, elevada autonomia na condu&ccedil;&atilde;o de casos de m&eacute;dia e alta complexidade, capacidade para defini&ccedil;&atilde;o de estrat&eacute;gias processuais, gest&atilde;o de carteira, controle de prazos e agenda em sistema, al&eacute;m de atua&ccedil;&atilde;o direta junto a clientes.</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(36, 36, 36); border: 1pt windowtext; padding: 0cm; font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;\">A posi&ccedil;&atilde;o exige dom&iacute;nio da rotina contenciosa, incluindo despachos com ju&iacute;zes e desembargadores, participa&ccedil;&atilde;o em audi&ecirc;ncias e reuni&otilde;es externas, negocia&ccedil;&atilde;o de acordos, excelente reda&ccedil;&atilde;o jur&iacute;dica e forte capacidade de an&aacute;lise cr&iacute;tica e avalia&ccedil;&atilde;o de riscos.</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;\"><strong><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; color: #242424; border: none windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-alt: none windowtext 0cm; padding: 0cm; mso-fareast-language: PT-BR;\">Principais atribui&ccedil;&otilde;es</span></strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"color: rgb(36, 36, 36); border: 1pt windowtext; padding: 0cm;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&middot;<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-weight: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; color: #242424; border: none windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-alt: none windowtext 0cm; padding: 0cm; mso-fareast-language: PT-BR;\">Atua&ccedil;&atilde;o em processos de Contencioso C&iacute;vel Geral, em todas as fases processuais, considerando uma carteira diversificada de mat&eacute;rias;<br>&middot; Condu&ccedil;&atilde;o de demandas de m&eacute;dia e alta complexidade, incluindo temas relacionados a Direito de Fam&iacute;lia, Recupera&ccedil;&atilde;o de Cr&eacute;dito, Contratos, Responsabilidade Civil, Obriga&ccedil;&otilde;es e mat&eacute;rias correlatas;</span></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"color: rgb(36, 36, 36); border: 1pt windowtext; padding: 0cm;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&middot;<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-weight: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; color: #242424; border: none windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-alt: none windowtext 0cm; padding: 0cm; mso-fareast-language: PT-BR;\">Elabora&ccedil;&atilde;o e revis&atilde;o de pe&ccedil;as processuais, incluindo peti&ccedil;&otilde;es iniciais, contesta&ccedil;&otilde;es, r&eacute;plicas, recursos, manifesta&ccedil;&otilde;es e demais pe&ccedil;as jur&iacute;dicas;</span></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"color: rgb(36, 36, 36); border: 1pt windowtext; padding: 0cm;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&middot;<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-weight: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; color: #242424; border: none windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-alt: none windowtext 0cm; padding: 0cm; mso-fareast-language: PT-BR;\">Acompanhamento processual e gest&atilde;o de prazos em sistemas eletr&ocirc;nicos dos tribunais;</span></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"color: rgb(36, 36, 36); border: 1pt windowtext; padding: 0cm;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&middot;<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-weight: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; color: #242424; border: none windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-alt: none windowtext 0cm; padding: 0cm; mso-fareast-language: PT-BR;\">An&aacute;lise de publica&ccedil;&otilde;es, decis&otilde;es e senten&ccedil;as, com defini&ccedil;&atilde;o e proposi&ccedil;&atilde;o de estrat&eacute;gias processuais;</span></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"color: rgb(36, 36, 36); border: 1pt windowtext; padding: 0cm;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&middot;<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-weight: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; color: #242424; border: none windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-alt: none windowtext 0cm; padding: 0cm; mso-fareast-language: PT-BR;\">Avalia&ccedil;&atilde;o de riscos, cen&aacute;rios e alternativas jur&iacute;dicas para subsidiar a tomada de decis&atilde;o dos clientes e do escrit&oacute;rio;</span></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"color: rgb(36, 36, 36); border: 1pt windowtext; padding: 0cm;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&middot;<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-weight: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; color: #242424; border: none windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-alt: none windowtext 0cm; padding: 0cm; mso-fareast-language: PT-BR;\">Participa&ccedil;&atilde;o em audi&ecirc;ncias de concilia&ccedil;&atilde;o, instru&ccedil;&atilde;o e julgamento;</span></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"color: rgb(36, 36, 36); border: 1pt windowtext; padding: 0cm;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&middot;<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-weight: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; color: #242424; border: none windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-alt: none windowtext 0cm; padding: 0cm; mso-fareast-language: PT-BR;\">Realiza&ccedil;&atilde;o de despachos com magistrados e demais interlocu&ccedil;&otilde;es necess&aacute;rias &agrave; condu&ccedil;&atilde;o estrat&eacute;gica dos processos;</span></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"color: rgb(36, 36, 36); border: 1pt windowtext; padding: 0cm;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&middot;<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-weight: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; color: #242424; border: none windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-alt: none windowtext 0cm; padding: 0cm; mso-fareast-language: PT-BR;\">Atua&ccedil;&atilde;o em negocia&ccedil;&otilde;es, composi&ccedil;&atilde;o de acordos e tratativas extrajudiciais;</span></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"color: rgb(36, 36, 36); border: 1pt windowtext; padding: 0cm;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&middot;<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-weight: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; color: #242424; border: none windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-alt: none windowtext 0cm; padding: 0cm; mso-fareast-language: PT-BR;\">Elabora&ccedil;&atilde;o de relat&oacute;rios processuais e materiais executivos para acompanhamento da carteira;</span></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"color: rgb(36, 36, 36); border: 1pt windowtext; padding: 0cm;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&middot;<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-weight: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; color: #242424; border: none windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-alt: none windowtext 0cm; padding: 0cm; mso-fareast-language: PT-BR;\">Contato direto com clientes para alinhamento de estrat&eacute;gias, apresenta&ccedil;&atilde;o de riscos e atualiza&ccedil;&atilde;o sobre o andamento dos processos;</span></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"color: rgb(36, 36, 36); border: 1pt windowtext; padding: 0cm;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&middot;<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-weight: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; color: #242424; border: none windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-alt: none windowtext 0cm; padding: 0cm; mso-fareast-language: PT-BR;\">Realiza&ccedil;&atilde;o de pesquisas jur&iacute;dicas e an&aacute;lise de jurisprud&ecirc;ncia e legisla&ccedil;&atilde;o aplic&aacute;vel;</span></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"color: rgb(36, 36, 36); border: 1pt windowtext; padding: 0cm;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&middot;<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-weight: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; color: #242424; border: none windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-alt: none windowtext 0cm; padding: 0cm; mso-fareast-language: PT-BR;\">Apoio t&eacute;cnico e orienta&ccedil;&atilde;o de advogados menos experientes e estagi&aacute;rios, quando necess&aacute;rio;</span></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"color: rgb(36, 36, 36); border: 1pt windowtext; padding: 0cm;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&middot;<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-weight: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; color: #242424; border: none windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-alt: none windowtext 0cm; padding: 0cm; mso-fareast-language: PT-BR;\">Identifica&ccedil;&atilde;o de oportunidades de melhoria na condu&ccedil;&atilde;o da carteira, buscando maior efici&ecirc;ncia, qualidade t&eacute;cnica e melhores resultados.</span></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;\"><strong><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; color: #242424; border: none windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-alt: none windowtext 0cm; padding: 0cm; mso-fareast-language: PT-BR;\">Requisitos:</span></strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"color: rgb(36, 36, 36); border: 1pt windowtext; padding: 0cm;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&middot;<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-weight: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; color: #242424; border: none windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-alt: none windowtext 0cm; padding: 0cm; mso-fareast-language: PT-BR;\">Gradua&ccedil;&atilde;o completa em Direito;</span></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"color: rgb(36, 36, 36); border: 1pt windowtext; padding: 0cm;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&middot;<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-weight: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; color: #242424; border: none windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-alt: none windowtext 0cm; padding: 0cm; mso-fareast-language: PT-BR;\">OAB ativa e regular;</span></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"color: rgb(36, 36, 36); border: 1pt windowtext; padding: 0cm;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\"